@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction

node "開發者電腦" {
  node "瀏覽器" as BR
  node "Vite 開發伺服器 :5173" as VITE
  node "Spring Boot :8080\nthe-ages-server" as SB
  node "Docker Compose" as DC {
    database "PostgreSQL 18 :5432" as PG
    database "Redis 8 :6379（預留）" as RD
  }
}

BR --> VITE : HTTP（頁面、模組）
VITE --> SB : 代理 /api、/ws
SB --> PG : JDBC
note right of SB : 沒有 Docker 時可改用\nspring-boot:test-run\n（H2 記憶體資料庫）
@enduml
